+Let $d_{ij}=\|\mathbf q_i-\mathbf q_j\|_2$ and $\Sigma_{ij}=\exp(-d_{ij}/\ell)$.
+With $LL^{\mathsf T}=\Sigma$ and independent standard normal vectors,
+\begin{align}
